#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.portal_user_welcome_email
msgid ""
"\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"user\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"user\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"partner.registration_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.event_id.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"event.country_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"/>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    WELCOME to the Muskathlon <t t-out=\"event.name\"/> from&nbsp;<t t-out=\"event.get_date('start_date', 'd')\"/> until <t t-out=\"event.get_date('end_date', 'date_full')\"/> - your extreme commitment against extreme poverty!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    The Muskathlon is organized by 4M Switzerland and 4M Germany in cooperation with the Christian charity for children, Compassion, and offers you the extraordinary opportunity to take part in the fight against child poverty and its consequences and at the same time take part in a sporting challenge on another continent.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    You will make the difference and experience that hope is stronger than poverty!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    With your registration a very special and great adventure has begun for you. We want to give you the best possible support and give you all the information and tips you need for your Muskathlon. Start with the preparation and read the \"Information Letter\" which is deposited on your profile. In the following months, we will provide you with more information material and remind you when to do what.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Soon you will receive mail from us with the invoice for the travel costs, various flyers and your training shirt.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Please activate your account and setup your password by clicking on this button:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{registration.portal_signup_url}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        Activate my account\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"&lt;&gt;\n"
"    Here are your access data:\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\"/>\n"
"<ul style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;\">\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Username: <t t-out=\"user.login or ''\"/>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Access link: <a t-attf-href=\"{{registration.host_url}}/my/events\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\">mycompassion.ch/my/events</a>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    If any questions arise, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    For questions about organization and travel: Nathalie Schranz, n.schranz@4m-switzerland.ch, 079 507 92 40\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    For questions about Compassion and sponsorships: Colin Ward, cward@compassion.ch, 077 261 36 76\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Nathalie, 4M Switzerland\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Colin, Compassion\n"
"</p></body>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"user\" t-value=\"partner.user_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"registration\" t-value=\"partner.registration_ids[:1]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"registration.event_id.compassion_event_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"event.country_id\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Bienvenue au\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"event.name\"></t> du <t t-out=\"event.get_date(&#x27;start_date&#x27;, &#x27;d&#x27;)\"></t> au <t t-out=\"event.get_date(&#x27;end_date&#x27;, &#x27;date_full&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"    </b>\n"
"    - ton engagement extrême contre l’extrême pauvreté !\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Le Muskathlon est organisé par 4M Suisse et 4M Allemagne, en collaboration avec l’ONG Compassion. Cette dernière te propose une opportunité unique de participer au combat contre la pauvreté infantile et ses conséquences, et en même de participer à un défi sportif sur un autre continent.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Tu fais une vraie différence et vas pouvoir expérimenter que l’espoir est plus fort que la pauvreté !\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Ton inscription marque le début d’une grande aventure. Compassion veut te soutenir du mieux possible et te transmettre toutes les informations nécessaires à la réussite de ton Muskathlon. Commence par te préparer en lisant la « lettre d’informations », qui se trouve sur ton profil. Au fil des mois, nous t’enverrons régulièrement des informations sur ce tu dois faire, quand, comment, etc.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Dans les prochains jours, tu recevras un courrier de notre part, avec la facture pour les frais de voyage, divers flyers et ton t-shirt d’entraînement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Voici tes données d’accès:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Nom d’utilisateur: <t t-out=\"user.login or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Lien d’accès:\n"
"        <a t-attf-href=\"{{registration.host_url}}/my/events\"><t t-out=\"registration.host_url\"></t>/my/events</a>\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Si tu as des questions, n’hésite pas à nous contacter.\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Pour des questions concernant l’organisation et le voyage : Fabio Lechner, f.lechner@4m-switzerland.ch, 078 712 43 48\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Pour des questions concernant Compassion et les parrainages : Colin Ward, cward@compassion.ch, 076 588 57 56\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Cordialement,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Fabio, 4M Suisse\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Colin, Compassion Suisse\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

