#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation_fail
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reminder\" t-value=\"object.search([('config_id', '=', object.config_id.id), ('partner_id', '=', partner.id), ('state', '=', 'done')])\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately, we have not received any feedback from you and will have to cancel the sponsorship for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>We will now look for another sponsor for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Have you changed your mind? Then let us know as soon as possible and increase your sponsorship contribution to CHF 42:\n"
"<a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The joy of <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> will be enormous!</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_1_year
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sum(sponsorships.mapped('total_amount')) and partner in sponsorships.mapped('partner_id')\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Congratulations, it's been a year since you became the sponsor of <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>A sponsorship is a long-term investment in the life of a child. To learn more, click here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eB-8APGpGo\">video</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for being a part of this mission!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>A Write&amp;Pray sponsorship is a team effort between you and a donor.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"    If you would like to increase your financial support,\n"
"    </t><t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    If you would like to take on CHF 2/5/10 of the financial support yourself,\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    you can do so here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">mycompassion</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The team of Compassion</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Félicitations, cela fait un an que tu parraines <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Un parrainage est un investissement à long terme dans la vie d'un enfant. Pour en savoir plus, clique ici: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eB-8APGpGo\">video</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci de faire partie de cette mission!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Un parrainage Write&amp;Pray est un effort d'équipe entre un donateur et toi. Si tu souhaites prendre en charge toi-même CHF 2.-/5.-/10.- du soutien financier (ou si tu souhaites augmenter ton soutien financier), tu peux le faire ici: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">mycompassion</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bonne journée et à bientôt!</p>\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24<br/>\n"
"Des questions? Écris-nous sur WhatsApp: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_contribution_reminder_mail
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_reminder\" t-value=\"object.search_count([('config_id','=',object.config_id.id),('partner_id','=',partner.id),('state','=','done),('object_ids','like',sponsorships.ids[:1]),('id','!=',object.id)])\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately, we have not yet received a donation from you for the contribution of the sponsorship that you would like to pay yourself.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"number_reminder\">\n"
"This is already the <t t-out=\"'second' if number_reminder == 1 else 'third'\"/> time that we have contacted you about this. Thank you for taking care of this quickly.\n"
"</t><t t-else=\"\">\n"
"Thank you for taking care of this quickly: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donation\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Can you not take care of this part yourself? Then contact us so that we can find another donor for it.\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_reminder\" t-value=\"object.search_count([(&#x27;config_id&#x27;,&#x27;=&#x27;,object.config_id.id),(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;,&#x27;=&#x27;,partner.id),(&#x27;state&#x27;,&#x27;=&#x27;,&#x27;done&#x27;),(&#x27;object_ids&#x27;,&#x27;like&#x27;,sponsorships.ids[:1]),(&#x27;id&#x27;,&#x27;!=&#x27;,object.id)])\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Pour info, nous n'avons pas encore reçu de don de ta part pour la partie du parrainage que tu aimerais payer toi-même.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"number_reminder\">\n"
"Ceci est déjà la <t t-out=\"&quot;deuxième&quot; if number_reminder == 1 else &quot;troisième&quot;\"></t> fois que nous te le rappelons. Merci d'avance d'effectuer le paiement au plus vite.\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"Peux-tu effectuer le paiement au plus vite? <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donation\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Tu n'es pas en mesure de payer cette partie toi-même? Prends contact avec nous, pour que nous puissions trouver un autre donateur.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"<br/>Des questions? Tchate avec nous sur MyCompassion: <a t-attf-href=\"{{wp_tchat_url}}\"><t t-out=\"wp_tchat_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_upgrade_confirmation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered('last_paid_invoice_date')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_mode\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('payment_mode_id.name')[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"'LSV' in payment_mode or 'Postfinance' in payment_mode\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"survey\" t-value=\"object.env['ir.config_parameter'].get_param('web.external.url') + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_journey_survey').get_start_url()\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wow, we are happy that you would like to provide financial support for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>. Thank you very much!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not lsv_dd\">\n"
"<p>In order for you to <t t-out=\"'increase' if payer else 'set up'\"/> your donation for the sponsorship,\n"
"you can find the payment slip here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Download payment slip</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"    <p>Your feedback on the Write &amp; Pray sponsorship is important to us. It takes about 1 minute. Thank you for filling it out: <a t-att-href=\"survey\">Link to survey</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'sms'\">\n"
"<p>We will communicate with you by email instead of SMS.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not partner.email\">\n"
"Thank you for communicating your email address as soon as possible.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'digital'\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered('last_paid_invoice_date')\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"payment_mode\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('payment_mode_id.name')[0]\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"'LSV' in payment_mode or 'Postfinance' in payment_mode\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"survey\" t-value=\"object.env['ir.config_parameter'].get_param('web.external.url') + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_journey_survey').get_start_url()\"/>\n"
"  <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"/>,</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Wouaw, nous sommes très reconnaissants que tu veuilles prendre en charge le\n"
"  soutien financier de <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>. Merci beaucoup!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"not lsv_dd\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"      Pour que tu puisses mettre en place/augmenter ton don pour ton filleul, tu\n"
"      trouveras le bulletin de versement ici:\n"
"      <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Télécharger le bulletin</a>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"  </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Nous communiquerons avec toi par e-mail plutôt que par SMS. Merci de nous\n"
"  communiquer ton adresse e-mail au plus vite.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Ton feedback sur le parrainage Write&amp;Pray est très important. Merci de\n"
"  prendre 1 minute pour le remplir: <a t-att-href=\"survey\">questionnaire</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci beaucoup, bonne journée et à bientôt!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  L'équipe de Compassion<br/>\n"
"  Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"</p>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reminder\" t-value=\"object.search([('config_id', '=', object.config_id.id), ('partner_id', '=', partner.id), ('state', '=', 'done')])\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>This year you will turn 25, congratulations!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for supporting <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> with a Write&amp;Pray sponsorship for <t t-out=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration//365 or 1\"/> years.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Our Write&amp;Pray sponsorships are for young people under the age of 25. Most sponsors have the financial means to fully resume a sponsorship after that.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>It would be great if you would continue to sponsor <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> for CHF 42.00 per month, so that together we can continue to free children from poverty. You can choose to do so here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"reminder\">\n"
"    <p>If we do not receive any feedback from you within the next two weeks, we will unfortunately have to terminate the sponsorship and look for a new sponsor for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>Have a good day and see you soon!</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"reminder\" t-value=\"object.search_count([(&quot;config_id&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, object.config_id.id), (&quot;partner_id&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, partner.id), (&quot;state&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, &quot;done&quot;)])\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Cette année, tu auras 25 ans. Félicitations!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci d’avoir parrainé <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> pendant <t t-out=\"sponsorships[:1].contract_duration//365 or 1\"></t> années avec un parrainage Write&amp;Pray.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Nos parrainages Write&amp;Pray sont destinés aux jeunes de moins de 25 ans. La plupart des parrains ont les moyens financiers de reprendre complètement un parrainage après cela. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Ce serait formidable si tu continuais à parrainer <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> pour CHF 42.- par mois. Tu peux le faire ici: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"<t t-if=\"reminder\">\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Sans réponse de ta part dans les deux prochaines semaines, nous devrons malheureusement mettre fin au parrainage et chercher un nouveau parrain pour <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bonne journée et à bientôt!</p>\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24<br/>\n"
"Des questions? Écris-nous sur WhatsApp: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation_complete
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for deciding to support the sponsorship of <t t-out=\"firstname\"/> financially.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>There is one more thing you can do: Would you take a few minutes to give one or two other teens the opportunity to join the fight against extreme poverty?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Tell them about your experience as a Write &amp; Pray sponsor and encourage them to do the same.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Together, we can accomplish much more: <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/writeandpray/\">Write&amp;Pray</a>\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"            Thank you so much!\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci d’avoir décidé de soutenir désormais aussi financièrement le parrainage de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Ta mission Write &amp; Pray n’est cependant pas terminée. Peux-tu prendre quelques minutes pour offrir à un autre jeune adulte ou ado, la possibilité de prendre part à la lutte contre l’extrême pauvreté?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Explique-lui ton expérience de parrain/marraine Write &amp; Pray et encourage-le/la à t’imiter.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Ensemble, nous pouvons multiplier notre impact et augmenter davantage encore le nombre d’enfants libérés de l’extrême pauvreté. <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/writeandpray/\">Write&amp;Pray</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout cœur et a bientôt.<br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sponsorship_upgrade_confirmation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered('last_paid_invoice_date')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"amount\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('group_id')[:1].get_amount('2200-01-01','2200-02-01', sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_mode\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped('payment_mode_id.name')[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"'LSV' in payment_mode or 'Postfinance' in payment_mode\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wow, we are happy that you would like to take over CHF <t t-out=\"int(amount)\"/> of financial support for <t t-out=\"firstname\"/>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not lsv_dd\">\n"
"<p>In order for you to <t t-out=\"'increase' if payer else 'set up'\"/> your donation for the sponsorship,\n"
"you can find the payment slip here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Download payment slip</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == 'digital'\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"amount\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&quot;group_id&quot;)[:1].get_amount(&quot;2200-01-01&quot;,&quot;2200-01-31&quot;, sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_mode\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_mode or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_mode\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"wp_tchat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Wouaw, nous sommes très reconnaissants que tu veuilles prendre en charge le soutien financier de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>. Merci beaucoup!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"not lsv_dd\">\n"
"<p>Pour que tu puisses mettre en place/augmenter ton don pour ton filleul, tu trouveras le bulletin de versement ici: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Télécharger le bulletin</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"<br/>Des questions? Tchate avec nous sur MyCompassion: <a t-attf-href=\"{{wp_tchat_url}}\"><t t-out=\"wp_tchat_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.m2m_stop_template
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.m2m_welcome_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body>\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"      <br/>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"  </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"zoom\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    La prochaine rencontre de nouveaux parrains de Compassion approche à grands pas.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Souhaitez-vous découvrir en images l’annonce du parrainage d’un enfant à sa famille, les différentes facettes et l’impact du parrainage?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Inscrivez-vous et rejoignez d’autres parrains tranquillement depuis chez vous, le <t t-out=\"zoom.get_date(&#x27;date_start&#x27;, &#x27;dd MMMM à HH:mm&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/zoom/register\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Cliquez pour vous inscrire\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci d’investir dans la vie de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> et de <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ses&#x27;)\"></t> proches. Vous êtes en train de changer le monde, un enfant à la fois.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sub_accept
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\">\n"
"    <p>TODO</p>\n"
"  <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lui\" t-value=\"&#x27;leur&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"votre\" t-value=\"&#x27;vos&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"autre\" t-value=\"&#x27;autres&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"filleul\" t-value=\"&#x27;filleuls&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"lui\" t-value=\"&#x27;lui&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"votre\" t-value=\"&#x27;votre&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"autre\" t-value=\"&#x27;autres&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"filleul\" t-value=\"&#x27;filleul&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(sponsorship) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"phrase\" t-value=\"&quot;Comme pour votre autre filleul&quot;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"phrase\" t-value=\"&quot;Comme pour vos autres filleuls&quot;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"contracts\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"period\" t-value=\"contracts.group_id.advance_billing_months\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SC&quot; in sponsorship.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"others\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids - sponsorship\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&quot;child_id&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&quot;preferred_name&quot;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_attachment\" t-value=\"sponsorship.get_payment_type_attachment_string()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_name\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_representative&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_link\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_video_link&#x27;, 1, &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/histoires-danciens-filleuls-de-compassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci beaucoup d'avoir décidé d'investir dans la vie d'un nouvel enfant !\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"&quot;Permanent&quot; in sponsorship[:1].with_context(lang=&#x27;en_US&#x27;).payment_mode_id.name\">\n"
"        Si vous n'avez pas encore mis fin à votre ordre permanent, vous n'avez rien à entreprendre. Nous nous occupons de tout pour que ce parrainage puisse débuter. Si vous avez déjà mis fin à votre ordre permanent, <b>vous trouverez ci-joint un bulletin de versement pour établir votre ordre permanent.</b>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"&quot;BVR&quot; in sponsorship[:1].with_context(lang=&#x27;en_US&#x27;).payment_mode_id.name\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"period == 1\">\n"
"                Vous trouverez ci-joint des bulletins de versement pour le règlement du parrainage.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                Vous trouverez ci-joint un bulletin de versement pour le règlement de votre parrainage.\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <!-- # LSV -->\n"
"            Si vous n'avez pas encore mis fin à votre prélèvement automatique, vous n'avez rien à entreprendre. Nous nous occupons de tout pour que ce parrainage puisse débuter.\n"
"            <br/><br/>\n"
"           Si vous avez déjà mis fin à votre prélèvement automatique, <b>vous trouverez ci-joint le formulaire de prélèvement automatique. Nous vous prions de le remplir et de nous le renvoyer par la poste.</b>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"phrase\"></t>, vous pourrez écrire vos lettres et trouver toutes les informations et photos de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> dans MyCompassion.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/my/home\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            MyCompassion\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous souhaitons également vous présenter <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&quot;une ancienne enfant parrainée&quot; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27;  else &quot;un ancien enfant parrainé&quot;\"></t> de Compassion. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Elle&#x27; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;Il&#x27;\"></t> vit sur le même continent que <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a t-attf-href=\"{{alumni_link}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"&quot;Découvre&quot; if informal else &quot;Découvrez&quot;\"></t> l'histoire de <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<h3 style=\"color: #0054A6;\">\n"
"    <b>Voici ce que permet votre parrainage</b>\n"
"</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Accès à l’école (écolage, uniforme et fournitures)</li>\n"
"    <li>Suivi médical</li>\n"
"    <li>Formations (professionnelle ou académique)</li>\n"
"    <li>Développement spirituel auprès d'une communauté locale, enseignement biblique*</li>\n"
"    <li>Activités pour développer ses talents</li>\n"
"    <li>Une correspondance avec la marraine, le parrain</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p style=\"font-size: smaller\">\n"
"    *avec l'accord des parents\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>    \n"
"    L’enfant est accompagné personnellement jusqu’à la fin d’une formation professionnelle mais jusqu’à l’âge de 22 ans tout au plus.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/compassion-dans-le-monde/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            En savoir plus sur le pays où vit <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci pour votre engagement. Grâce à vous, un enfant ainsi que ses proches retrouvent de l’espoir pour leur avenir.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Chaleureusement,</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t></p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step5
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"partner.advocate_details_id.engagement_ids\" t-as=\"engagement\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"engagement.id == 2\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"engagement.id in (1,3,9)\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;invoice_line_ids&#x27;).filtered(&#x27;last_payment&#x27;) or 0 in sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)\">\n"
"        Congratulations, your <t t-out=\"&#x27;sponsorship has&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;sponsorships have&#x27;\"></t> started well! The good news has reached <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t> and <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;his&#x27;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;family&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;families&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    This is the final email you will receive from us concerning the start of your sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Your feedback regarding the start of your sponsorship<t t-out=\"&#x27;s&#x27; if not one_child else ''\"></t> is important to us. It should only take 60 seconds.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto;text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.onboarding_survey').get_start_url()}}\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        Take part in the questionnaire\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not translator or not event\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Did you know that Compassion is a network of many actively engaged people? This network is made up of you and other sponsors, Compassion staff in different countries and over <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> local church partners in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not translator\">\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            In Switzerland, around 100 volunteers translate numerous letters from sponsors and sponsored children. Would you be interested in helping us?\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Many volunteers help in the fight against extreme poverty by participating at Compassion events or church services or through prayer. Do you want to get involved?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto;text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/sich-mehr-engagieren/\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"            Volunteer\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We would also like to present you our interactive fundraising platform TOGETHER. Here you can start your own project!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto;text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://together.compassion.ch/homepage\" style=\"padding:12px 18px;font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        TOGETHER\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Our heartfelt thanks for investing in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of &#x27; + firstname if one_child else (&#x27;lives of &#x27; + firstname if less_4 else &#x27;lives of many children&#x27;)\"></t>! We wish you much joy throughout the journey.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids.filtered(&#x27;is_active&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorship.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;tu&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;te&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"toi\" t-value=\"&quot;toi&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ton\" t-value=\"&quot;ton&quot; if informal else &quot;votre&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tes\" t-value=\"&quot;tes&quot; if informal else &quot;vos&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) &gt; 3 and len(child) &lt; 11\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"firstname.capitalize()\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"False\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"base_url\" t-value=\"object.env[&#x27;ir.config_parameter&#x27;].get_param(&#x27;web.external.url&#x27;) + &quot;/fr_CH&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-foreach=\"partner.advocate_details_id.engagement_ids\" t-as=\"engagement\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"engagement.id == 2\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"translator\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"engagement.id in (1,3,9)\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"event\" t-value=\"True\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;invoice_line_ids&#x27;).filtered(&#x27;last_payment&#x27;) or 0 in sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;total_amount&#x27;)\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"&quot;Votre parrainage d’un enfant démuni a&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;Vos parrainages d&#x27;enfants démunis ont&quot;\"></t> bien commencé. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> et <t t-out=\"&#x27;ses&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;leurs&#x27;\"></t> proches ont été informés de la bonne nouvelle.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    Voici le dernier courriel d'information pour bien démarrer <t t-out=\"&#x27;votre parrainage&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;vos parrainages&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Avez-vous encore une question sur le parrainage ? Vous pouvez consulter notre page des questions les plus fréquentes <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/questions-frequentes/\" title=\"\">cliquez ici</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vos commentaires sur le début du parrainage sont importants pour nous. Cela ne devrait pas prendre plus de 1 minute. L'enquête est anonyme.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{base_url + object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.onboarding_survey').get_start_url()}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"        Démarrer le sondage\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"not translator or not event\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Compassion est avant tout une formidable chaîne humaine, formée de parrains de Compassion dans différents pays, de collaborateurs dans les centres de développement de l'enfant et de plus de <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Eglises partenaires dans <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> pays.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        En Suisse, une centaine de bénévoles traduisent de nombreuses lettres de parrains et de filleuls, nous aident à tenir des stands ou contribuent à faire rayonner la mission de Compassion dans leur Eglise ou par la prière. Etes-vous intéressé<t t-out=\"&#x27;s&#x27; if plural else partner.get(&#x27;accord_e&#x27;) or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> à participer à une de ces activités enrichissantes ? Pour augmenter le nombre d’enfants libérés de l’extrême pauvreté, nous cherchons à compléter notre réseau de bénévoles.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/participer/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Bénévole pour Compassion\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Un autre moyen pour augmenter votre impact dans les pays du Sud: la plateforme TOGETHER vous permet de créer un projet et d'inviter vos proches à le soutenir. A découvrir ici:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://together.compassion.ch/fr_CH/homepage\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Votre projet pour Compassion\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout cœur pour votre engagement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step4
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != child.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_time\" t-value=\"(datetime.date.today().month)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field_office_ids\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;).ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"special\" t-value=\"1 in field_office_ids or 19 in field_office_ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Your letters and prayers make a difference in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of your sponsored child&#x27; if one_child else &#x27;lives of your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In a letter from her sponsors, Michelle from the Philippines read for the first time in her life the words \"You are beautiful, you are precious, we love you\". Today, over 25 years later, the impact of letter exchanges with her sponsors is still evident: Michelle has started an aid organisation to help victims of prostitution and human trafficking.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Why not write a letter and send a photo to <t t-out=\"firstname if less_4 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t> for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> to get to know you better. You can write via <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/en_US/my/letter\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"christmas_time &gt; 8\">\n"
"        Why not send your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> a Christmas card now?\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Do you need inspiration?</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/was-soll-ich-meinem-patenkind-schreiben/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        5 ideas for letter writing\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"special\">\n"
"    <p>Extra information on writing letters to your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;child&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;children&#x27;\"></t>.</p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:20px auto; text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_EN.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Information about letter writing:\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Another important letter writing information: To ensure the protection of the children, but also for your own safety, the communication between you and your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t> must run solely through us.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Please never mention:<br/></p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Your postal address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your email address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your phone number</li>\n"
"    <li>Compassion Switzerland's address</li>\n"
"    <li>Your Facebook or other social media contact details</li>\n"
"    <li>Making promises (e.g. a gift or visit)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    It's so wonderful that you're investing in the <t t-out=\"&#x27;life of &#x27; + firstname if one_child else &#x27;lives of your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Warm regards,</p>\n"
"<p><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t></p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorship.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;tu&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;te&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"toi\" t-value=\"&quot;toi&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ton\" t-value=\"&quot;ton&quot; if informal else &quot;votre&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tes\" t-value=\"&quot;tes&quot; if informal else &quot;vos&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get(&#x27;ton filleul&#x27;) if informal else child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_time\" t-value=\"(datetime.date.today().month)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"field_office_ids\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;).ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"special\" t-value=\"1 in field_office_ids or 19 in field_office_ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vos lettres et vos prières font toute la différence dans la vie de <t t-out=\"&#x27;votre filleul&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;vos filleuls&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Aux Philippines, Michelle a «entendu» pour la première fois de sa vie les mots «Tu es belle, tu as de la valeur, nous t’aimons» dans une lettre de ses parrains. Aujourd’hui, plus de 25 ans après, elle témoigne encore de l’impact que les échanges avec ses parrains ont eu dans sa vie. Michelle a lancé une ONG qui vient en aide aux victimes d’esclavage moderne.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Pour que <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;puisse&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;puissent&#x27;\"></t> mieux vous connaître, vous pouvez vous présenter avec une photo et une lettre. Vous pouvez nous écrire via <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/ecrire/\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"    <t t-if=\"christmas_time &gt; 9\">\n"
"        Profitez de l'approche de Noël pour lui envoyer une lettre de vœux!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><b>Besoin d'inspiration ?</b></p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/que-dois-je-ecrire-a-mon-filleul\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        5 idées pour rédiger vos lettres\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"special\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Des recommandations spéciales s'appliquent pour la correspondance avec <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> et sont consultables ici:\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/medias/onboarding/BD_SL_child_communication_fr.pdf\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Recommandations spéciales\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Pour la protection de l’enfant et la vôtre, toute la correspondance passe par Compassion.  Ne mentionnez jamais les informations suivantes dans vos lettres :\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        votre adresse postale\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        votre adresse électronique\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        votre numéro de téléphone\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        les coordonnées de vos comptes de réseaux sociaux\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        l’adresse de Compassion Suisse\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        une promesse d'envoi d'un cadeau ou d'une visite\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de changer la vie de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> !\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step3
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(child) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    This is the third of five emails that you will receive from us.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    What does poverty mean in the life of your sponsored child<t t-out=\"&#x27;ren&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    The causes and effects of poverty can differ depending on the context.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion is active in areas where life is extremely difficult. Be it in Central America, where families live with the danger of gang violence on a daily basis; Africa, where diseases, alcohol, drugs dominate every day life; or Asia, where children are threatened with prostitution or child labour.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Every child deserves to be able to go to school, be protected and experience a childhood filled with hope for the future.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    This is an important part of Compassion's work. <b>A sponsorship protects a child from child labour and other forms of slavery, particularly from gang violence and forced marriage.</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Together we can protect children!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/kinderschutz\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        More information on child protection\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id.country_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorship.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get(&#x27;ton filleul&#x27;) if informal else child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Voici déjà le troisième des cinq courriels promis. A quoi ressemble la pauvreté dans le pays de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Les causes de la pauvreté diffèrent selon le contexte. Il existe la pauvreté urbaine et rurale. Chaque jour, 7 millions de personnes arrivent dans les mégapoles à la recherche de travail et s’entassent dans des bidonvilles. Vulnérables, elles sont exposées aux pires formes de pauvreté et d’exploitation. Dans les campagnes, la vie est rude, les perspectives de travail sont limitées.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Compassion est engagé dans des régions où la vie est particulièrement difficile. En Amérique latine, les familles sont exposées à la violence des gangs. En Afrique, les maladies, l’alcool, la drogue et la pauvreté traditionnelle font des ravages. En Asie, des enfants sont menacés d’exploitation par des réseaux mafieux liés à l’industrie du sexe ou du travail des enfants.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Notre mission : protéger les enfants</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaque enfant mérite d’aller à l’école, d’être protégé et de vivre une enfance digne.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Protéger les enfants du travail forcé et de toute autre forme d’esclavagisme, de la violence des gangs et des mariages forcés est un des axes essentiels de la mission de Compassion.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/protection-enfants/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        En savoir plus sur la protection des enfants\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_sub_dossier_new
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"previous\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id.child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"previous_name\" t-value=\"previous.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We recently informed you that <t t-out=\"previous.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t>, <t t-out=\"previous_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"previous.get(&#x27;is&#x27;)\"></t> no longer participating in the sponsorship program. We suggested that you sponsor another child who really needs help.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Enclosed you will find information about <t t-out=\"name\"></t> in <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;project_id.country_id.name&#x27;)\"></t>. Would you again be prepared to invest in a life to release <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> from extreme poverty?\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Jennifer, for example lost her mother when she was only 14 years old. Today she is a lawyer. “In my sponsors letters, I was always encouraged to persevere and to improve.“\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sponsorship changes the life of a child. Your commitment makes a huge difference for a child, for the family and the entire environment.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   If you do not want to support this child, please let us know as soon as possible so that we can find another sponsor for <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for everything you have already done for a child in poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for responding to this request.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Sincerely,\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"previous\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;parent_id.child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"previous_name\" t-value=\"previous.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_term\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;payment_mode_id.name&#x27;)[0]\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"lsv_dd\" t-value=\"&#x27;LSV&#x27; in payment_term or &#x27;Postfinance&#x27; in payment_term\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"plural\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"pret_a_le\" t-value=\"&#x27;prêts à la&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"pret_a_le\" t-value=\"&#x27;prêts à le&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"pret_a_le\" t-value=\"&#x27;prête à la&#x27;\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"pret_a_le\" t-value=\"&#x27;prête à le&#x27;\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"child.gender == &#x27;F&#x27;\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"pret_a_le\" t-value=\"&#x27;prêt à la&#x27;\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"pret_a_le\" t-value=\"&#x27;prêt à le&#x27;\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout coeur d'avoir investi dans la vie de <t t-out=\"previous_name\"></t>. Après la fin d'un parrainage, une des plus belles choses dans notre travail, c'est de pouvoir mettre en relation un enfant qui vit dans l'extrême pauvreté avec un parrain, une marraine.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>Nous nous réjouissons de vous présenter <t t-out=\"name\"></t>, <t t-out=\"child[:1].age\"></t> ans, de <t t-out=\"child.get_list(&#x27;project_id.country_id.name&#x27;)\"></t>.</b> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;he&#x27;).title()\"></t> attend un parrain ou une marraine comme vous.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaque enfant est unique et mérite un avenir plein d'espérance et de perspectives. Les informations ci-jointes vous permettent de faire un peu plus connaissance avec <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. Voyez un peu ses défis et ses rêves, ainsi que la manière dont vous pouvez apporter un soutien dans sa vie.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Une majorité de parrains décident de soutenir un nouvel enfant. C'est pourquoi, nous avons simplifié au maximum la reprise du parrainage de <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. <b>Seriez-vous <t t-out=\"pret_a_le\"></t> parrainer ?</b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"lsv_dd\">\n"
"        Si vous n'avez pas encore mis fin à votre prélèvement automatique, vous n'avez rien à entreprendre. Nous nous occupons de tout pour que ce parrainage puisse débuter. Le prélèvement du don de parrainage se poursuivra normalement.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Si vous n'avez pas encore mis fin à votre ordre permanent, vous n'avez rien à entreprendre. Nous nous occupons de tout pour que ce parrainage puisse débuter.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        Si nous devions chercher un autre parrain ou une autre marraine pour <t t-out=\"name\"></t> ou si vous désirez soutenir un autre enfant, d'avance merci de prendre contact avec nous par mail ou par téléphone dans les deux semaines qui viennent. Sans nouvelle, nous partons de l'idée que vous souhaitez soutenir cet enfant, afin de poursuivre votre engagement de lutte contre l'extrême pauvreté.\n"
"    </b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nous sommes impatients d’annoncer la bonne nouvelle de ce parrainage à <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. Merci d'investir dans la vie d'enfants vivant dans l'extrême pauvreté.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Recevez nos chaleureuses salutations.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step2
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_name\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_representative&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"apos\" t-value=\"&quot;&#x27;&quot; if alumni_name[-1] == &#x27;s&#x27; else &quot;&#x27;s&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_link\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_video_link&#x27;, 1, &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"multi_link\" t-value=\"alumni_link == &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/geschichten-ehemaliger-patenkinder-von-compassion&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>, your sponsorship is making a difference!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not multi_link\">\n"
"        Today, we would like to introduce you to <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, a former sponsored child of Compassion. <t t-out=\"&#x27;She&#x27; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;He&#x27;\"></t> lives on the same continent as <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Today, we would like to introduce you to <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, former sponsored children of Compassion. They on the same continent as <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{alumni_link}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">Discover\n"
"    <t t-if=\"multi_link\">\n"
"        their stories\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"alumni_name + apos\"></t> story\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<h3 style=\"color: #0054A6; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <b>You enable <t t-out=\"firstname if len(child) &lt; 4 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t>:</b>\n"
"</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Access to school (school fees, uniform, material, tutoring)</li>\n"
"    <li>Higher education (vocational training or university studies)</li>\n"
"    <li>Medical care</li>\n"
"    <li>Hygiene training and regular balanced meals</li>\n"
"    <li>Love and care from a local church, bible teaching*</li>\n"
"    <li>Encouragement to explore their personality as they learn and play</li>\n"
"    <li>Letter contact with you</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p style=\"font-size: smaller\">\n"
"    *In agreement with the child's parents\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The child will be supported until the end of school, including vocational training, but at most until the age of 22.</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/compassion-weltweit\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Get to know more about the country where <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;lives&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;live&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>Thanks to you, not only a child, but a whole family can find new hope for the future.</p>\n"
"<p>Warm regards,</p>\n"
"<p><t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t></p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"child.mapped(&#x27;field_office_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_name\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_representative&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"alumni_link\" t-value=\"country.get_list(&#x27;alumni_video_link&#x27;, 1, &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/histoires-danciens-filleuls-de-compassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"multi_link\" t-value=\"alumni_link == &#x27;https://vimeo.com/showcase/histoires-danciens-filleuls-de-compassion&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorship.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;tu&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"te\" t-value=\"&quot;te&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"toi\" t-value=\"&quot;toi&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ton\" t-value=\"&quot;ton&quot; if informal else &quot;votre&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tes\" t-value=\"&quot;tes&quot; if informal else &quot;vos&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get(&#x27;ton filleul&#x27;) if informal else child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation if informal else partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    L'impact de <t t-out=\"ton\"></t> parrainage est réel!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not multi_link\">\n"
"        Aujourd'hui, nous souhaitons vous présenter <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, <t t-out=\"&quot;une ancienne enfant parrainée&quot; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27;  else &quot;un ancien enfant parrainé&quot;\"></t> de Compassion. <t t-out=\"&#x27;Elle&#x27; if child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == &#x27;F&#x27; else &#x27;Il&#x27;\"></t> vit sur le même continent que <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Aujourd'hui, nous souhaitons vous présenter <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>, des anciens enfants parrainés de Compassion. Ils vivent sur les mêmes continents que <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{alumni_link}}\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Découvre l'histoire de <t t-out=\"alumni_name\"></t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<h3 style=\"color: #0054A6; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        Voici ce que permet <t t-out=\"ton\"></t> parrainage\n"
"    </b>\n"
"    :\n"
"</h3>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Accès à l’école (écolage, uniforme et fournitures)\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Suivi médical\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Formations (hygiène, artisanat, cuisine)\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Développement spirituel\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Activités pour développer ses talents\n"
"    </li>\n"
"    <li>\n"
"        Une correspondance avec la marraine, le parrain\n"
"    </li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    L'enfant est accompagné personnellement jusqu’à la fin d’une formation professionnelle mais jusqu’à l’âge de 22 ans tout au plus.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/compassion-dans-le-monde/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        En savoir plus sur le<t t-out=\"&#x27;&#x27; if len(country) == 1 else &#x27;s&#x27;\"></t> pays où <t t-out=\"&#x27;vit&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;vivent&#x27;\"></t> <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci pour votre engagement. Grâce à vous, un enfant ainsi que ses proches trouvent de l’espoir pour leur avenir.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(sponsorships) &gt; 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"has\" t-value=\"&#x27;have&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"has\" t-value=\"&#x27;has&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"others\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids - sponsorships\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;) and len(sponsorships.filtered(&#x27;period_paid&#x27;)) != len(sponsorships)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, children.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_3\" t-value=\"firstname != children.get_number()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"apos\" t-value=\"&quot;&#x27;&quot; if firstname[-1] == &#x27;s&#x27; else &quot;&#x27;s&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_attachment\" t-value=\"sponsorships.get_payment_type_attachment_string()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"is_new\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        It's so nice to have you as part of the Compassion family!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Thank you so much for deciding to sponsor <t t-out=\"&#x27;more children&#x27; if plural else &#x27;another child&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    With your help alongside around <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> partner churches we are currently releasing over <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> million children from poverty in <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> countries. Together we enable children to have a life with hope and a future.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"        After receiving your first donation, <t t-out=\"&#x27;the children&#x27; if plural else firstname\"></t> will be informed that <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;he&#x27;)\"></t> now <t t-out=\"has\"></t> a sponsor.\n"
"        <b>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"payment_attachment\"></t>\n"
"        </b>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"len(partner.sponsorship_ids) == len(sponsorships)\">\n"
"            Please <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/zahlungsart-deiner-patenschaft\">click here</a> if you have any questions about your donation.\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    In a series of short emails over the coming month, we will explain everything you need to know about <t t-out=\"firstname if less_3 else &#x27;the children&#x27;\"></t> and the sponsorship.\n"
"</p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        Register and discover MyCompassion to write to your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;children&#x27; if plural else &#x27;child&#x27;\"></t>, download photos and letters, find out more and adapt information linked to your <t t-out=\"&#x27;sponsorships&#x27; if plural else &#x27;sponsorship&#x27;\"></t> and much more.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Just like for your other sponsorships, you will find all of <t t-out=\"firstname + apos if less_3 else &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"></t> information and photos on MyCompassion and you can write to <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/home\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        MyCompassion\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Thank you so much for making the decision to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"firstname if less_3 else &#x27;many children&#x27;\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;tu&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"toi\" t-value=\"&quot;toi&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ton\" t-value=\"&quot;ton&quot; if informal else &quot;votre&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tes\" t-value=\"&quot;tes&quot; if informal else &quot;vos&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"others\" t-value=\"partner.sponsorship_ids - sponsorships\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(others) &gt; 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"others_phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;vos autres filleuls&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"children[0].gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"others_phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;votre autre filleul&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"others_phrase\" t-value=\"&#x27;votre autre filleule&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"is_new\" t-value=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, children.get_number(), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname_yours\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, children.get(&#x27;ton filleul&#x27;) if informal else children.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;), translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payer\" t-value=\"object.partner_id in sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;partner_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"payment_attachment\" t-value=\"sponsorships.get_payment_type_attachment_string()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"informal\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"payment_attachment\" t-value=\"payment_attachment.replace(&#x27;Vous trouverez&#x27;, &#x27;Tu trouveras&#x27;).replace(&#x27;votre&#x27;, &#x27;ton&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children_in_poverty\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;children_in_poverty&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"early_deaths\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;early_deaths&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_mothers\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_mothers&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_unacceptable_conditions\" t-value=\"object.env[&quot;partner.communication.job&quot;].get_snippet(&#x27;number_unacceptable_conditions&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        Bienvenue dans la famille Compassion!\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Merci beaucoup d'avoir décidé d'investir dans la vie <t t-out=\"&quot;d&#x27;un enfant supplémentaire&quot; if len(children)==1 else (&quot;de &quot;+str(len(children))+&quot; enfants supplémentaires&quot;)\"></t> !\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Avec vous, Compassion est en train de libérer <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> millions d'enfants de l'extrême pauvreté aux côtés de <t t-out=\"number_fcps\"></t> Eglises locales dans <t t-out=\"number_countries\"></t> pays. Pour une vie digne, remplie d’espérance et de promesses.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"payer\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"payment_attachment\"></t>. Nous nous réjouissons de recevoir votre premier don afin de pouvoir annoncer la bonne nouvelle à <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vous trouverez  <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/comment-payer-votre-parrainage/\">ici</a> plus d'informations sur les différents moyens de verser vos dons de parrainage.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Dans le mois qui vient, plusieurs brefs courriels vous expliqueront tout ce que vous devez savoir sur <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> et sur le programme de parrainage de Compassion.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"is_new\">\n"
"        Enregistrez-vous sur MyCompassion et accédez à votre compte de parrain. Vous pourrez écrire à votre <t t-out=\"&#x27;filleul&#x27; if children[0].gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;filleule&#x27;\"></t>, télécharger les lettres et les photos, retrouver toutes les informations relatives à votre parrainage, et bien plus encore.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        Comme pour <t t-out=\"others_phrase\"></t>, vous pourrez trouver toutes les informations et photos de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> dans MyCompassion et <t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;lui_leur&#x27;)\"></t> écrire.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/de_DE/my/home\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            MyCompassion\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Encore une fois, merci de tout cœur pour votre engagement pour <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &quot;digital&quot;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_step1
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"one_child\" t-value=\"len(children) == 1\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine_patenkinder\" t-value=\"&#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine_patenkinder, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != deine_patenkinder\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.informal_salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        This is the first of five emails that you will receive from us.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Today we will help you get to know <t t-out=\"children.get_child_preposition_country(&#x27;from_preposition&#x27;, child_limit=3, country_limit=3, child_substitution=deine_patenkinder, country_substitution=deine_patenkinder)\"></t> better (PDF attached).\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Did you know that you can visit your sponsored <t t-out=\"&#x27;children&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;child&#x27;\"></t>?\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/de/reisen/\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            More information on visits\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Thank you for deciding to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"&#x27;more children&#x27; if not one_child else &#x27;another child&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Warm regards\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"children\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"less_4\" t-value=\"firstname != vos_filleuls\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SWP&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"informal\" t-value=\"wp and not plural\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"vos_filleuls\" t-value=\"children.get(&quot;ton filleul&quot;) if informal else children.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"children.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, vos_filleuls, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tu\" t-value=\"&quot;tu&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"toi\" t-value=\"&quot;toi&quot; if informal else &quot;vous&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"ton\" t-value=\"&quot;ton&quot; if informal else &quot;votre&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"tes\" t-value=\"&quot;tes&quot; if informal else &quot;vos&quot;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"country\" t-value=\"children.get_child_preposition_country(&quot;from_preposition&quot;, child_limit=3, country_limit=3, child_substitution=vos_filleuls, country_substitution=vos_filleuls, repeat_preposition=True).replace(&#x27;duTogo&#x27;,&#x27;du Togo&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;)\">\n"
"        Ceci est le premier des cinq courriels annoncés.\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Aujourd'hui, nous souhaitons vous présenter <t t-out=\"country\"></t> (voir le<t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;accord_s&#x27;)\"></t> dossier<t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;accord_s&#x27;)\"></t> PDF en pièce<t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;accord_s&#x27;)\"></t> jointe<t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;accord_s&#x27;)\"></t>).\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-if=\"sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;) and not wp\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Par ailleurs, c’est une joie pour nous de vous inviter à une vidéo-conférence pour les nouveaux parrains. Pendant une heure, vous y découvrirez l’impact du parrainage et son fonctionnement. Vous pourrez également poser toutes vos questions.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center;  text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"        <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/zoom/register\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"            Prochaine rencontre et inscription\n"
"        </a>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous nous réjouissons de faire votre connaissance.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Merci beaucoup d'avoir choisi d'investir dans la vie <t t-out=\"&quot;d&#x27;&quot; if len(children) == 1 else &quot;de &quot;\"></t><t t-out=\"children.get_number()\"></t> supplémentaire<t t-out=\"children.get(&#x27;accord_s&#x27;) or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>!\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Le saviez-vous? Si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez rendre visite à <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"margin:30px auto; text-align: center;  text-transform: uppercase;\">\n"
"    <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/voyager\" style=\"padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Plus d'informations sur les visites\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != 'physical'\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"/></t><t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"/></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_no_sub
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   We understand and acknowledge  you have decided not to take over a new sponsorship at this time.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you for your past investment in the life of a child living in poverty.  More than 70 years of experience assures us that this commitment produces sustainable results. <t t-out=\"object.success_sentence or &#x27;&#x27;\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   If you have set up an automatic payment order for your sponsorship, please cancel it.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Did you know that you can also help children in poverty by giving them access to drinking water (water filters, toilet installations, hygiene awareness)? With a one-time gift or regular donations of CHF 10, 20 or 30 per month - you can make a big difference.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   If you are interested, please call us at 031 552 21 25 or you can also donate online on www.compassion.ch/spenden\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you again for your generosity so far.\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"     <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"</t>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" </div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div class=\"communication-text\" t-att-style=\"&#x27;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;&#x27; if object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27; else None\"><p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nous avons pris note de votre décision de ne pas vous engager pour un nouveau parrainage d'enfant pour l'instant.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout cœur d'avoir investi dans la vie d'un enfant vivant dans la pauvreté. Votre engagement a apporté une réelle transformation dans sa vie.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <b>\n"
"        Si vous avez réglé jusqu'ici votre parrainage par un ordre permanent, n'oubliez pas d'annuler ce dernier.\n"
"    </b>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Le parrainage d’enfants est le programme principal de Compassion pour libérer chaque jour plus d’enfants de l’extrême pauvreté. Compassion s’engage avec d’autres programmes aussi. Saviez-vous qu’il est possible d’apporter un soutien aux femmes enceintes et aux mamans d’un nouveau-né?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Avec un don ponctuel ou régulier, vous pouvez faire une grande différence: donner accès à des soins médicaux pendant la grossesse, assurer un accouchement dans une structure médicale, des formations à la parentalité, un soutien psychologique, social et spirituel, une aide matérielle ainsi qu'une formation pour générer des revenus.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Avec CHF 15.-, vous pouvez soutenir une femme et son bébé pendant une semaine entière. Nous serions ravis que vous nous contactiez ou que vous fassiez un don <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/donations/\">ici</a> pour continuer à faire une différence dans la lutte contre l'extrême pauvreté.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Avec nos meilleures salutations.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p></div></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.sms_confirmation_email_1
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"image_url\" t-value=\"child.image_url.replace(&#x27;media.ci.org/&#x27;, &#x27;media.ci.org/g_face,c_thumb,w_150,h_150,r_max/&#x27;) if child.image_url else None\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"confirmation_url\" t-value=\"&quot;/child/&quot; + str(child.id) + &quot;/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot;\"/>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"image_url\">\n"
"<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center;&gt;&#10;&lt;img src=\">\n"
"</div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"                <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                  Hello!\n"
"                  </p>\n"
"                  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                   It's so wonderful that you wish to invest in the life of <t t-out=\"child.preferred_name\"></t>. You will change <t t-out=\"child.get(&quot;his&quot;)\"></t> life in a sustainable way.\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    <a t-attf-href=\"{{confirmation_url}}\" style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#0055A6;text-decoration: underline;\">Click here</a> to complete your details.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"<br/><br/>\n"
" <t t-out=\"object.user_id.preferred_name\"></t> <t t-out=\"object.user_id.lastname\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.employee_ids.department_id.name\"></t>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <t t-out=\"object.user_id.company_id.address_name\"></t>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorship\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorship.child_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"name\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"image_url\" t-value=\"child.image_url.replace(&#x27;media.ci.org/&#x27;, &#x27;media.ci.org/g_face,c_thumb,w_150,h_150,r_max/&#x27;) if child.image_url else None\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"confirmation_url\" t-value=\"&quot;/child/&quot; + str(child.id) + &quot;/sponsor/confirmation?face_reveal=1&quot;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<t t-if=\"image_url\">\n"
"    <div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n"
"        <img t-attf-src=\"{{image_url}}\" title=\"\"/>\n"
"    </div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Bonjour,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci d'avoir décidé d'investir dans la vie de <t t-out=\"name\"></t>. Vous allez contribuer à changer sa vie durablement. <a t-attf-href=\"{{confirmation_url}}\">Cliquez ici</a> pour compléter vos coordonnées et permettre à votre parrainage de démarrer.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Regardez bien vos courriels, des informations pour bien démarrer votre parrainage vous seront envoyées dans les jours qui viennent.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ensemble, changeons le monde, un enfant à la fois.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_wrpr_child_info
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, deine + &#x27;n Patenkindern&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine_patenkinder\" t-value=\"&#x27;deine Patenkinder&#x27; if not plural else &#x27;eure Patenkinder&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"chat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/im_livechat/support/2&quot;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.user_ids.login_date\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/my/children&quot;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"chat_url\" t-value=\"my_url\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.email and not partner.signup_url\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"not partner.env[&quot;res.users&quot;].search_count([(&quot;login&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, partner.email)])\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"partner.env[&quot;res.partner.create.portal.wizard&quot;].with_context(active_ids=partner.ids).create({&quot;create_communication&quot;: False}).button_create_portal_user()\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"partner.action_signup_prepare()\"/>\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"partner.env.clear()\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"partner.signup_url or &quot;https://mycompassion.ch/web/signup&quot;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"2/8:\n"
"<br/><t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">Heute stellen wir <t t-out=\"dir\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get_child_preposition_country(child_limit=3, country_limit=3, child_substitution=deine_patenkinder, country_substitution=deine_patenkinder)\"></t> besser vor.\n"
"</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    <t t-if=\"not sponsorships.filtered(&quot;is_first_sponsorship&quot;) and partner.user_ids\">\n"
"Wie bisher <t t-out=\"&quot;werdet ihr&quot; if plural else &quot;wirst du&quot;\"></t> alle Informationen zu <t t-out=\"deine\"></t>r <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;Patenschaft&#x27;)\"></t> in MyCompassion finden: <a t-attf-href=\"{{my_url}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\"><t t-out=\"my_url\"></t></a>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"<t t-out=\"&quot;Registriert euch&quot; if plural else &quot;Registriere dich&quot;\"></t> dazu auf MyCompassion: <a t-attf-href=\"{{my_url}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\"><t t-out=\"my_url\"></t></a>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\"><t t-out=\"&quot;Stellt euch&quot; if plural else &quot;Stell dir&quot;\"></t> einmal <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;seine&#x27;)\"></t> Herausforderungen und Träume vor und wie <t t-out=\"du\"></t> <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ihn&#x27;)\"></t> darin ermutigen und unterstützen <t t-out=\"&quot;könnt&quot; if plural else &quot;kannst&quot;\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">Danke, dass <t t-out=\"du\"></t> einen Unterschied im Leben von <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> <t t-out=\"&quot;macht&quot; if plural else &quot;machst&quot;\"></t>.</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"Sarah<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"Fragen? <a t-attf-href=\"{{chat_url}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);\"><t t-out=\"chat_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"du\" t-value=\"&#x27;ihr&#x27; if plural else &#x27;du&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine\" t-value=\"&#x27;eure&#x27; if plural else &#x27;deine&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;).get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;tes enfants parrainés&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dir\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dir&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"dich\" t-value=\"&#x27;euch&#x27; if plural else &#x27;dich&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"deine_patenkinder\" t-value=\"&#x27;deine Patenkinder&#x27; if not plural else &#x27;eure Patenkinder&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"chat_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3&quot;\"/>\n"
"      <t t-if=\"partner.user_ids.login_date\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"&quot;https://mycompassion.ch/my/children&quot;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"chat_url\" t-value=\"my_url\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"partner.email and not partner.signup_url\">\n"
"            <t t-if=\"not partner.env[&quot;res.users&quot;].search_count([(&quot;login&quot;, &quot;=&quot;, partner.email)])\">\n"
"                <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"partner.env[&quot;res.partner.create.portal.wizard&quot;].with_context(active_ids=partner.ids).create({&quot;create_communication&quot;: False}).button_create_portal_user()\"/>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"partner.action_signup_prepare()\"/>\n"
"            <t t-set=\"void\" t-value=\"partner.env.clear()\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"my_url\" t-value=\"partner.signup_url or &quot;https://mycompassion.ch/web/signup&quot;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Salut <t t-out=\"partner.firstname or partner.name\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Aujourd'hui, nous allons te présenter <t t-out=\"child.get_child_preposition_country(&#x27;from_preposition&#x27;, child_limit=3, country_limit=3, child_substitution=&#x27;tes enfants parrainés&#x27;, country_substitution=&#x27;dans différents pays&#x27;)\"></t>.\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"Pour cela, inscris-toi sur MyCompassion: <a t-attf-href=\"{{my_url}}\"><t t-out=\"my_url\"></t></a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Découvre <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ses&#x27;)\"></t> défis et <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ses&#x27;)\"></t> rêves et comment tu peux <t t-out=\"&quot;l’&quot; if len(child) == 1 else &quot;les &quot;\"></t>encourager et <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;le_la&#x27;)\"></t> soutenir.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci de faire une différence dans la vie de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Bonne journée et à bientôt!\n"
"<br/>L'équipe de Compassion<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24<br/>\n"
"Des questions? Écris-nous sur WhatsApp: +41 (0)79 622 31 97\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.csp_mail_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"contracts\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Thank you to support a child survival program from Compassion.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   From pregnancy through infanthood, Child Survival offers help that moms and babies desperately need to survive and thrive. More than 64,598 moms and babies have been helped to date! Through our Child Survival Centers, we ensure mothers and babies receive any of the following:\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
"  <ul style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;\">\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Basic Nutrition in the form of clean water, healthy food and vitamins.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Pre-natal and post-natal medical exams to monitor mom and baby’s health.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Critical medical resources such as child birth assistance.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Monthly growth monitoring to protect the children from malnutrition.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Immunizations and other medical care for newborns and babies.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Mentoring from a survival specialist that gives one-on-one coaching and support.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Opportunities for infants to learn cognitive skills.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Workshops that teach mothers parenting and survival skills.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Home visits to check in on mother and baby.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"   <li>\n"
"    Emotional support from a community of moms facing the same fears.\n"
"   </li>\n"
"  </ul>\n"
"  Each Child Survival Center is staffed with warm, caring, knowledgeable individuals that serve mothers and babies extremely well. Your donations give children under 1 year old a head start toward a healthy life!\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  There is no correspondence with the mothers, nevertheless you will receive a newsletter with information about the program and testimonies from mothers.\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  <br/>\n"
"  Sincerely\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"contracts\" t-value=\"partner.other_contract_ids\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"christmas_fund_2022\" t-value=\"265 in partner.category_id.ids\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout cœur pour votre décision de soutenir notre programme d'entraide pour mamans et tout-petits (CSP).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ce programme s'adresse spécialement à des mères et à leurs enfants ainsi qu'à des femmes enceintes vivant dans l’extrême pauvreté. Il les soutient dans leurs besoins physiques, économiques et sociaux avant et après la naissance. De nombreuses études démontrent que la première année est déterminante dans la vie d’un enfant.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Grâce à votre soutien, les bébés et les mères bénéficient de:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>nourriture et vitamines</li>\n"
"    <li>contrôles médicaux pré- et postnataux</li>\n"
"    <li>contrôles mensuels, pour prévenir la malnutrition</li>\n"
"    <li>vaccinations et soins médicaux pour les nouveau-nés (jusqu’à l’âge d’un an)</li>\n"
"    <li>accompagnement spirituel et coaching pour les mères et les femmes enceintes</li>\n"
"    <li>soutien au développement cognitif des bébés</li>\n"
"    <li>ateliers éducatifs pour les mères</li>\n"
"    <li>encouragements par d’autres mères</li>\n"
"    <li>visites à domicile</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nous vous remercions pour votre générosité. Grâce à vous, tout est mis en œuvre pour que le début de la vie de ces bébés se passe bien. Une source d’espoir et de réconfort pour de nombreuses mères dans le besoin.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vous recevrez régulièrement des nouvelles et des témoignages des programmes pour mamans et tout-petits soutenus par les donateurs de Compassion Suisse.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nous sommes à disposition pour toute question sur ce programme.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Chaleureusement.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_sponsorship_anniversary_5
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"   <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"                    \n"
"<t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"  <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"Congratulations! It’s been 5 years since you’ve been supporting <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>! On behalf of the entire team at Compassion Switzerland, we would like to thank you for your commitment to a child in extreme poverty.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Your sponsorship has a great impact on the development of this child. It enables <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;him&#x27;)\"></t> to live a life without extreme poverty but with dignity and real hope. <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> is one of 2,3 million children currently supported by Compassion’s sponsorship program. Thank you for working together with us.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"   Yours sincerely.\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"  </p>\n"
" <t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()   \"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, child.get_number(), False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_years\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_years&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_children\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_children&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_fcps\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_fcps&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"number_countries\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;number_countries&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_uc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_uc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"years_lc\" t-value=\"object.get_snippet(&#x27;years_lc&#x27;, strip_html=True)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Félicitations ! Merci de tout cœur de votre engagement depuis cinq ans pour libérer <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> de l'extrême pauvreté.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Par votre parrainage, vous offrez à <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t> du courage et de l'espoir de pouvoir concrétiser <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;ses&#x27;)\"></t> propres rêves.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de votre précieuse fidélité !\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"firstname.title().replace(&quot;Enfants&quot;,&quot;enfants&quot;)\"></t> <t t-out=\"&#x27;fait&#x27; if len(child) == 1 else &#x27;font&#x27;\"></t> partie des\n"
"    <t t-out=\"number_children\"></t> millions d'enfants soutenus actuellement par les marraines et parrains de Compassion.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ensemble, nous changeons le monde, un enfant à la fois.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode == &#x27;digital&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.compassion_reset_password_email
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"<t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"link\" t-value=\"str(partner.signup_url).replace(&#x27;erp.compassion&#x27;, &#x27;mycompassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"<p style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    Dear <t t-out=\"partner.preferred_name\"></t>,\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"    You have requested a new password for your Compassion Account. You may change your password by following this link which will remain valid during 24 hours:\n"
"   </p>\n"
"   <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(119, 119, 119); text-align: center; margin-top: 16px;\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{link}}\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background-color:transparent;color:rgb(124, 123, 173);padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#875A7B; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #875A7B; border: 1px solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px\">\n"
"     Change password\n"
"    </a>\n"
"   </div>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"   <p style=\"margin:0px 0 1rem 0;font-size:13px;font-family:&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n"
"    If you do not expect this, you can safely ignore this email.\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"     Thank you for your committed effort in the fight against extreme poverty. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.\n"
"     <br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"    Best Regards,\n"
"   <br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"    Compassion Switzerland\n"
"   </p>\n"
" </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"link\" t-value=\"str(partner.signup_url).replace(&#x27;erp.compassion&#x27;, &#x27;mycompassion&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Une demande de réinitialisation de votre mot de passe pour votre compte de Mycompassion.ch nous est parvenue.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Vous pouvez changer votre mot de passe en suivant ce lien qui restera valide pendant 24 heures :\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 16px; text-transform: uppercase\">\n"
"    <a t-attf-href=\"{{link}}\" style=\"padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #FFFFFF; border-color:#0054A6; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0px; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; background-image: none; background-color: #0054A6; border: 1px solid #0054A6; border-radius:3px\" title=\"\">\n"
"        Changer mon mot de passe\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Merci beaucoup pour votre participation à la lutte contre l'extrême pauvreté. N'hésitez pas à nous contacter si vous avez des questions.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Meilleures salutations,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"L'équipe de Compassion Suisse\n"
"</p></body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.auto_reminder_archive_partners_template
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <b>The following partners meet the criteria (see <a href=\"/web#action=521&amp;active_id=895&amp;cids=1&amp;id=600&amp;menu_id=2029&amp;model=project.task&amp;view_type=form\">T0024</a>) and are considered invalid : </b>\n"
"                    <span style=\"font-family: 'miller';\">\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"ctx.get(&#x27;partners_to_archive&#x27;)\" t-as=\"partner\">\n"
"                        <p><a t-attf-href=\"/web#id={{partner.id}}&amp;model=res.partner&amp;view_type=form\">Ref <t t-out=\"partner.ref\"></t> - <t t-out=\"partner.name\"></t></a></p>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"                    <b>The following partners meet the criteria (see <a href=\"/web#action=521&amp;active_id=895&amp;cids=1&amp;id=600&amp;menu_id=2029&amp;model=project.task&amp;view_type=form\">T0024</a>) and are considered invalid : </b>\n"
"                    <span style=\"font-family: 'miller';\">\n"
"                    <t t-foreach=\"ctx.get('partners_to_archive')\" t-as=\"partner\">\n"
"                        <p><a t-attf-href=\"/web#id={{partner.id}}&amp;model=res.partner&amp;view_type=form\">Ref <t t-out=\"partner.ref\"/> - <t t-out=\"partner.name\"/></a></p>\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            </body>\n"
