#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_new_labels
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, 3, &#x27;your sponsored children&#x27;, False)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) == 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"anewsheet\" t-value=\"&#x27;a new sheet&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"&#x27;child&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"anewsheet\" t-value=\"&#x27;the new sheets&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"&#x27;children&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Thank you for investing into the life of <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Please find enclosed <t t-out=\"anewsheet\"></t> of labels for the letters you wish to send by post.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Do you know that you can write your letters easily in your <a href=\"https://www.mycompassion.ch\">MyCompassion profile</a>? With it, you always have the pictures, letters and information of your <t t-out=\"child\"></t> at hand.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Enjoy writing!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Kind regards,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.short_signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</t>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"firstname\" t-value=\"child.get_list(&#x27;preferred_name&#x27;, translate=False)\"/>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Merci d'investir dans la vie de <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Vous trouverez ci-joint un nouveau jeu d'étiquettes pour la correspondance avec votre <t t-out=\"&#x27;filleul&#x27; if child\n"
"        .gender == &#x27;M&#x27; else &#x27;filleule&#x27;\"></t>. N'oubliez pas de coller une étiquette sur chaque élément de l'envoi (carte,\n"
"        autocollants, dessins, etc) destiné à <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Vous pouvez également lui écrire depuis www.mycompassion.ch.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous sommes à disposition pour toute question.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous vous souhaitons beaucoup de plaisir dans l'écriture de lettres à <t t-out=\"firstname\"></t>.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Avec nos chaleureuses salutations et à bientôt,\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.send_mode != &#x27;physical&#x27;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.user_id.signature\"></t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"</div>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation_not_read
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"object.get_objects().mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"partner.salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    We recently sent you an email to <t t-out=\"partner.email\"></t>, which doesn't seem to have reached you. Could you please let us know if you have a different email address. If our email went to the spam folder, could you please add compassion@compassion.ch to your address book? This way you will receive all the important information about <t t-out=\"child.get(&#x27;your sponsored child&#x27;)\"></t> in the future.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Below is the communication we sent you:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<span>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.env.ref(&#x27;partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation&#x27;).generate_email(object.id, [&#x27;body_html&#x27;])[&#x27;body_html&#x27;].replace(partner.salutation, &#x27;&#x27;).strip().replace(&#x27;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;, &#x27;&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"</span>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"sponsorships\" t-value=\"object.get_objects()\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"child\" t-value=\"sponsorships.mapped(&#x27;child_id&#x27;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"wp\" t-value=\"&quot;SC&quot; in sponsorships.mapped(&quot;type&quot;)\"/>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"plural\" t-value=\"partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\"/>\n"
"    <t t-if=\"len(child) &gt; 1\">\n"
"        <t t-set=\"filleul\" t-value=\"&#x27;vos filleuls&#x27;\"/>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"        <t t-if=\"child.gender == &#x27;M&#x27;\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"filleul\" t-value=\"&#x27;votre filleul&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"<t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-set=\"filleul\" t-value=\"&#x27;votre filleule&#x27;\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"salutation\" t-value=\"partner.salutation + &#x27;,&#x27;\"/>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"salutation\"></t>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nous vous avons récemment envoyé un courriel à <t t-out=\"partner.email\"></t>, qui ne semble pas vous être parvenu. Vous  serait-il possible de nous faire savoir si vous avez une adresse électronique différente ? Si notre courriel est arrivé dans le dossier de spams, vous serait-il possible d'ajouter compassion@compassion.ch à votre carnet d'adresses ? Ainsi, vous recevrez à l'avenir toutes les informations importantes concernant <t t-out=\"filleul\"></t>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Voici ce que nous vous avons écrit:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<span>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.env.ref(&#x27;partner_communication_switzerland.mail_onboarding_sponsorship_confirmation&#x27;).generate_email(object.id, [&#x27;body_html&#x27;])[&#x27;body_html&#x27;].replace(salutation, &#x27;&#x27;).strip().replace(&#x27;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;, &#x27;&#x27;)\"></t>\n"
"</span>\n"
"\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.email_wrpr_reminder
msgid ""
"<html>\n"
"  <body><div>\n"
"    <t t-set=\"partner\" t-value=\"object.partner_id\"/>\n"
